  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to \"Easy Street\" — Your Family’s Next Dream Vacation Spot near 30A<br><br>Step into luxury and relaxation at Easy Street, a stunning brand-new construction vacation home, perfectly located just a short stroll to Ed Walline Park — 30A’s largest public beach access — and mere minutes to the famous Shunk Gulley Oyster Bar and Restaurant, plus the shopping, dining, and entertainment hub of Gulf Place.<br>Your Private Outdoor Oasis:<br>The backyard feels like your own private resort, featuring a small sparkling plunge pool, a 6-burner Viking gas grill, and a fully equipped outdoor kitchen. With space to gather, swim, and dine, you may find it hard to leave the house!<br>Cruise to the beach in style with your private 6-seater golf cart, or grab one of the four bikes provided and explore the scenic paved bike trails that stretch along 30A. Inside the three-level vacation home, every detail has been thoughtfully curated for your comfort and enjoyment. From the moment you enter, you'll notice the striking design and high-end furnishings in soothing natural tones that create a relaxed coastal vibe.<br><br>Main Living Spaces:<br>The second-level open-concept kitchen, dining, and living areas make gathering with family and friends effortless. Dine indoors at the large main dining table, pull up a seat at the center island, or enjoy al fresco meals on the balcony dining area overlooking the neighborhood. The kitchen is a cook’s dream, featuring a 6-burner Viking gas range, Viking refrigerator, top-of-the-line dishwasher, drawer microwave, and luxurious natural-finish cabinetry. It's fully equipped and ready to feed a crowd.<br>The second level also features a Queen bedroom with private ensuite bath, and a King bedroom with ensuite bath that is also accessible from the Kitchen and Main Living area.<br>Private Downstairs Retreat:<br>On the ground level, you’ll find a private gathering room, perfect for football parties or movie nights. This level also includes a well-appointed pool bath, twin bunks, and a Queen bedroom with private ensuite bath.<br>Bedrooms & Baths:<br>Spread out across three floors, Easy Street offers 6 serene King and Queen bedrooms, each featuring ensuite bathrooms for ultimate comfort and convenience. Well-placed bunk beds on both the first and third floors make it perfect for kids or teens traveling together.<br>Additional Amenities:<br>•\tAiry balconies on the second and third floors for morning coffee or sunset cocktails<br>•\tLaundry facilities on both the first and third floors for ultimate convenience<br>•\tBikes, and golf cart included<br>•\tFast Wi-Fi and smart TVs throughout the home<br>•\tParking for 3 vehicles<br>At Easy Street, you'll find everything you need for a luxurious, relaxing, and adventure-filled 30A getaway. The hardest part of your stay will be having to leave!<br><br>**All bookings require a signed rental agreement, a copy of a government issued photo ID matching your credit card and the rental agreement, and a $500 security deposit hold (Rental agreement must be signed within 48 hours of booking, or the reservation will be subject to cancellation.)<br>** No Smoking<br>** No Parties or Events<br>** No pets<br>** Must be at least 25 years old to rent and the person booking must stay in the condo through the duration of the rental.<br>** There must be one adult 25 or older present for every 3 guests under the age of 25.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
